n\n> *\"Jeff Bezos and venture capital are pouring hundreds of millions into centralized fractional real estate platforms like Arrived. But centralized platforms recreate the same fee-extracting middlemen and closed listing databases. We use sovereign, containerized agents and OSCAL-compliant smart contracts to turn real estate listings, compliance, and fractional ownership into an open, decentralized protocol.\"*\n\nIt takes a proven, hot market concept and delivers the truly decentralized, cryptographically governed future that Wall Street and PropTech are desperate for."}
